	<!-- Phase 9 (docs/BLOCKLIST_SELECTION_PLAN.md 6): the ONLY way an iOS host
	     can filter the app picker down to apps they actually have. iOS offers no
	     enumeration, but canOpenURL answers one narrow question per declared
	     scheme. Apple CAPS this array at 50 -- exceeding it does not degrade, the
	     whole array stops working.
	     Generated from apps/mobile/src/config/app-catalog.json; drift between the
	     two is caught by __tests__/native-config.test.ts, not by a build error.
	     Describe this in review notes as picker filtering: the same mechanism is
	     a known device-fingerprinting technique and Apple scrutinises long lists. -->
